{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>美國真人騷女星Kim Kardashian近日飛往意大利出席《第21屆羅馬電影節》，昨日於社交網站分享她於當地一個花園以一套黑點白底的露肩低胸連身裙示人，拖住兩隻斑點狗所拍的寫真，衣服與小狗非常配合，她留言大玩食字表示：「喺羅馬被『點』（Spotted）相。」她又與律政美劇《訴訟女王》（All's Fair）拍檔英國女星娜奧美屈絲（Naomi Watts）、美國女星Sarah Paulson與美國女星Niecy Nash一起合照，為劇集第2季造勢。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T01:41:00.855342+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":234,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T01:01:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T02:38:10.843381+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T01:38:25.220687+00:00","content_hash":"720c9d65cf9c512593d4f535180a9758b00f3bc9577bd7391cb5757945434748","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T01:41:00.855342+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}